sequenceDiagram
  actor n0 as Authenticated client
  participant n1 as OrdersController
  participant n2 as OrderService
  participant n3 as Database (EF Core)
  n0->>+n1: POST /api/Orders/{id}/cancel
  critical try
    Note right of n2: via IOrderService (dependency injection)
    n1->>+n2: await CancelOrderAsync(id, "requested by customer")
    n2->>n3: FindAsync(id) · Orders
    opt order == null
      n2--xn1: throw OrderNotFoundException
    end
    n2->>n2: Audit(order, reason)
    n2->>n3: SaveChangesAsync()
    deactivate n2
    n1-->>n0: NoContent()
  option catch OrderNotFoundException
    n1-->>n0: NotFound(ex.Message)
  end
  n1-->>-n0: HTTP response: Task#lt;IActionResult#gt;
